{"3639770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "KILLBOUND", "steam_appid": 3639770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639770/extras/d15e94fcb14200e3dd4458dfa1d33771.poster.avif?t=1781662301\" width=800 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639770/extras/d15e94fcb14200e3dd4458dfa1d33771.webm?t=1781662301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639770/extras/d15e94fcb14200e3dd4458dfa1d33771.mp4?t=1781662301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KILLBOUND </strong>is a fast-paced  short horror  in which you fight, shoot, rip, and run for your life- 90s-style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639770/extras/998922b25ee77c7acbe67dc4d47400da.poster.avif?t=1781662301\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639770/extras/998922b25ee77c7acbe67dc4d47400da.webm?t=1781662301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KILLBOUND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hardcore, fast-movement boomer shooter inspired by classic arena FPS design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a ritual-infested mountain town consumed by ritual madness, you must blast through relentless enemies and master tight combat spaces. You were sent to investigate. Now the cult wants you dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No stealth. Just blood. Just precision, speed, and survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, skill-based arena combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aggressive enemy waves and relentless encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use weapons, no stealth, no mercy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-speed movement with vertical combat spaces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old-school difficulty - mastery required</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639770/extras/d81d7697b9e589b8a8db4e56e6a7ac1b.poster.avif?t=1781662301\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639770/extras/d81d7697b9e589b8a8db4e56e6a7ac1b.webm?t=1781662301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639770/extras/d15e94fcb14200e3dd4458dfa1d33771.poster.avif?t=1781662301\" width=800 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639770/extras/d15e94fcb14200e3dd4458dfa1d33771.webm?t=1781662301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639770/extras/d15e94fcb14200e3dd4458dfa1d33771.mp4?t=1781662301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KILLBOUND </strong>is a fast-paced  short horror  in which you fight, shoot, rip, and run for your life- 90s-style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639770/extras/998922b25ee77c7acbe67dc4d47400da.poster.avif?t=1781662301\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639770/extras/998922b25ee77c7acbe67dc4d47400da.webm?t=1781662301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KILLBOUND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hardcore, fast-movement boomer shooter inspired by classic arena FPS design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a ritual-infested mountain town consumed by ritual madness, you must blast through relentless enemies and master tight combat spaces. You were sent to investigate. Now the cult wants you dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No stealth. Just blood. Just precision, speed, and survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, skill-based arena combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aggressive enemy waves and relentless encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use weapons, no stealth, no mercy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-speed movement with vertical combat spaces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old-school difficulty - mastery required</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639770/extras/d81d7697b9e589b8a8db4e56e6a7ac1b.poster.avif?t=1781662301\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639770/extras/d81d7697b9e589b8a8db4e56e6a7ac1b.webm?t=1781662301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "A brutal boomer shooter inside a collapsing cosmic prison. You are a bound executioner sent to restore cont